; cluster for all thermodynamic quantities: heat, temperature, entropy.
; thermodynamics is physics of energy in its thermal (disordered) form.
; heat IS molecular kinetic energy — spanda at the atomic level.
; cross-links to energy-varga: thermal energy is a form of energy.
; units: temperature in kelvin; heat/entropy in joules and joules/kelvin
; sangati roots
; entropy's definition S = k·ln(W) is atemporal: kaala is not the apeksha
; apeksha for entropy kramanusara is ushna (temperature), not thaalam (time)

(kosha thermodynamics-varga
  (vishesa physics-varga energy-varga)
  (swarupa subanta spanda)
  (matra kelvin joule)
  (yukta niyama avastha kaala))
